<title>USA: CCC says it bought 4,620 tonnes corn for Guatemala.</title>
<headline>CCC says it bought 4,620 tonnes corn for Guatemala.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Agriculture Department said it bought 4,620 tonnes of No. 2 or better yellow corn for donation to Guatemala.</p>
<p>It paid $130.89 per tonne, FOB, to Cargill Inc.</p>
<p>Shipment is for April 3-27.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
